"responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le05ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn4le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Travel Journal July 7th Pamplona, Spain</span></p>", "time": "50"}, {"image": "engenn4le05ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "I arrived in Pamplona late last night, and today I decided to explore. I was walking around the city, enjoying the sights, when suddenly hundreds of people started filling the streets.</p>", "time": "4000"}, {"image": "engenn4le05ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "They were very excited and they were all moving in the same direction. I wanted to know where they were going, so I followed them.</p>", "time": "17000"}, {"image": "engenn4le05ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "Soon we came to a very wide street with barriers along the side. People stood behind the barriers. Suddenly, everyone stopped talking and looked towards one end of the street. A group of men were running down the street as fast as they could, with a herd of bulls chasing them! Someone was trampled. It was all over very fast, but it was definitely an incredible experience! The town festival was the highlight of my vacation so far.</p>", "time": "25000"}, {"image": "engenn4le05ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 5, "text": "The hotel I am staying at ...", "time": "54000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le05ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">A travel journal</span>", "time": "5000"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span cla